  What a number is ("Orders today"): small, muted, one line (`MetricLabel`). Nothing for an empty text.
  Locals: text, font, color, className.
%><%_ if (locals.text !== null && locals.text !== undefined && locals.text !== '') { var _st = widgetKit.style(widgetKit.fontStyle(locals.font, locals.color)); _%>
